<title>NEW ZEALAND: Utilicorp extends offer for Power NZ shrs.</title>
<headline>Utilicorp extends offer for Power NZ shrs.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Utilicorp NZ Inc said on Thursday it had extended two of its takeover offers for shares in Power New Zealand to December 31.</p>
<p>The extension applies to the offers dated May 14 and September 20.</p>
<p>Utilicorp NZ is a unit of Utilicorp United Inc.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
